# What this branch tracks in z-ethan.
# The repository's shared .git/info/exclude (paper 1's 2026-08-16 policy) ignores most of z-ethan
# in every worktree. The rules below take precedence over it inside this folder.
# Tracked: code, environment files and input data (all of it already public in
# nuclear-learning-target-analysis-ReEDS). Local only: docs/, scratch/ and results/.
!/README.md
!/.gitignore
!/environment.yml
!/nlpaper/
!/nlpaper/*.py
!/nlpaper/README.md
!/notebooks/
!/notebooks/*.ipynb
!/data/
!/data/**
!/mc/
!/mc/pris_loader.py
!/mc/rds2_2025_units.csv
/docs/
/scratch/
/results/
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
